1
00:00:06,325 --> 00:00:09,415
Hey, uh, I just found out I have to be
at the telescope lab all weekend.

2
00:00:09,628 --> 00:00:12,288
(Raj:)Any chance you and Bernadette
could take care of my dog?

3
00:00:12,464 --> 00:00:16,194
- Why don't you put her in a kennel?
- Why don't you put your mother in a home?

4
00:00:19,671 --> 00:00:22,141
(Howard:)To be honest, she'd do better in the kennel.

5
00:00:23,675 --> 00:00:26,475
(Howard:)- I'll talk to Bernie. I'm sure it's fine.
- Thank you.

6
00:00:26,678 --> 00:00:29,148
(Sheldon:)It's happening. Leonard, it's happening.

7
00:00:29,348 --> 00:00:31,438
(Sheldon:)Professor Proton is coming to our house.

8
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:32,780
(Leonard:)You're kidding.

9
00:00:32,985 --> 00:00:35,955
(Howard:)You mean the guy who used to host
that lame kids show?

10
00:00:36,155 --> 00:00:39,145
(Sheldon:)And you just got yourself uninvited.

11
00:00:39,625 --> 00:00:42,655
See, I told you I'd find a tactful way
to do that.

12
00:00:42,861 --> 00:00:46,661
- How'd you get him to come to your house?
- As Professor Proton always says:

13
00:00:46,865 --> 00:00:50,665
"There is no problem you can't solve
if you use your noggin."

14
00:00:50,869 --> 00:00:53,669
- And he wrote him a check.
- Yeah, that too. Big check.

15
00:00:55,974 --> 00:01:03,024
(Raj:)Uncle Howard.

